-Hans\">会议日期和地点已确定。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">欠点</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けってん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缺点；缺陷；弱点；不足；短处；（考试）不及格；不合格成绩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175954\"><ruby>欠点<rp>(</rp><rt>けってん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があるけどやはり<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有缺点,但我仍然喜欢他。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">傑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">（数词）最...的；前...名的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">血圧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けつあつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">血压</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175700\"><ruby>血圧<rp>(</rp><rt>けつあつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>計<rp>(</rp><rt>はか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りましょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让我们测量血压。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">決意</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けつい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">决意；决断；决心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-i