)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>煙<rp>(</rp><rt>けむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他想吸烟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">煙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けむり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">烟；烟雾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227894\">エレベーターから<ruby>煙<rp>(</rp><rt>けむり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>臭<rp>(</rp><rt>くさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いがします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">从电梯里闻到烟雾。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">煙る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けむる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">冒烟；升起烟雾；闷烧；烟雾蒙蒙；看起来模糊；朦胧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家来</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けらい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">家臣；仆从；追随者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">蹴る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">踢；拒绝；驳回；踏；用力蹬</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"106276\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<rub