><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">票；券；债券；证书</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222131\">この<ruby>券<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は２<ruby>週間<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>有効<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这张门票有效两周。</span></div></li>"]